<svg is:raw style="width:100%;font-family:'Inter',serif;" viewBox="0 0 640 310" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="10" font-style="italic" opacity="0.7" text-anchor="middle" x="320" y="18">Self-assessment: Field or Content Operation?</text>

          <!-- 5 diagnostic rows -->
          <!-- Row 1 -->
          <rect fill="var(--highlight)" height="48" opacity="0.6" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="0.4" width="180" x="10" y="30"></rect>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" font-style="italic" x="20" y="46">Segments</text>
          <text fill="var(--ink)" font-size="8" x="20" y="60">Can you describe your audience by</text>
          <text fill="var(--ink)" font-size="8" x="20" y="71">arc position, not only by demographic?</text>

          <rect fill="var(--highlight)" height="48" opacity="0.6" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="0.4" width="180" x="200" y="30"></rect>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" font-style="italic" x="210" y="46">Channels</text>
          <text fill="var(--ink)" font-size="8" x="210" y="60">Is each surface designed for the arc</text>
          <text fill="var(--ink)" font-size="8" x="210" y="71">stage typical of users who arrive there?</text>

          <rect fill="var(--accent-light)" height="48" opacity="0.7" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="0.8" width="240" x="390" y="30"></rect>
          <text fill="var(--accent)" font-size="8.5" font-style="italic" opacity="0.8" x="400" y="46">Value Proposition</text>
          <text fill="var(--ink)" font-size="8" x="400" y="60">Can you state in one sentence what</text>
          <text fill="var(--ink)" font-size="8" x="400" y="71">the user becomes through the field?</text>

          <!-- Row 2 -->
          <rect fill="var(--highlight)" height="48" opacity="0.6" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="0.4" width="180" x="10" y="88"></rect>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" font-style="italic" x="20" y="104">Relationships</text>
          <text fill="var(--ink)" font-size="8" x="20" y="118">Does your relationship model change</text>
          <text fill="var(--ink)" font-size="8" x="20" y="129">based on where the user is in the arc?</text>

          <rect fill="var(--highlight)" height="48" opacity="0.6" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="0.4" width="180" x="200" y="88"></rect>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" font-style="italic" x="210" y="104">Key Resources</text>
          <text fill="var(--ink)" font-size="8" x="210" y="118">Is the lens documented, shared, and</text>
          <text fill="var(--ink)" font-size="8" x="210" y="129">applied consistently across all surfaces?</text>

          <rect fill="var(--highlight)" height="48" opacity="0.6" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="0.4" width="240" x="390" y="88"></rect>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" font-style="italic" x="400" y="104">Key Activities</text>
          <text fill="var(--ink)" font-size="8" x="400" y="118">Is field design an explicit activity, or</text>
          <text fill="var(--ink)" font-size="8" x="400" y="129">only content production?</text>

          <!-- Row 3 -->
          <rect fill="var(--highlight)" height="48" opacity="0.6" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="0.4" width="280" x="10" y="146"></rect>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" font-style="italic" x="20" y="162">Revenue Streams</text>
          <text fill="var(--ink)" font-size="8" x="20" y="176">Does your monetization model reward transformation depth</text>
          <text fill="var(--ink)" font-size="8" x="20" y="187">or only reach and volume?</text>

          <rect fill="var(--highlight)" height="48" opacity="0.6" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="0.4" width="330" x="300" y="146"></rect>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" font-style="italic" x="310" y="162">Key Partners</text>
          <text fill="var(--ink)" font-size="8" x="310" y="176">Do your partnerships extend the field's reach</text>
          <text fill="var(--ink)" font-size="8" x="310" y="187">without diluting the lens?</text>

          <!-- Scoring guide -->
          <rect fill="none" height="55" opacity="0.3" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-dasharray="3,3" stroke-width="0.5" width="620" x="10" y="210"></rect>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="9" font-style="italic" text-anchor="middle" x="320" y="228">Reading the assessment:</text>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle" x="320" y="243">7 yes: You are building a field.    4–6 yes: Hybrid - the field is emerging but not yet coherent.</text>
          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle" x="320" y="257">0–3 yes: You are running a content operation. The arc is not yet designed. It is happening by accident.</text>

          <text fill="var(--muted)" font-size="8.5" font-style="italic" text-anchor="middle" x="320" y="295">No score is a verdict. Every score is a starting point.</text>
        </svg>